    <briefdescription>
<para>This structure contains the parameters for the Get Device Provisioning Certificate command (SAS section 12.16.2). </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The ASU checks the internal exportable key vault for the calling subsystem&apos;s provisioning authentication key pair (ECC NIST P-384) and provisioning wrapping key pair (ECIES over NIST P-384); any pair that is missing is generated with the TRNG and stored in the exportable vault. A UDE-signed X.509 certificate is generated over each public key, the DPC container (Device DNA, both certificates and a UDE signature over them) is assembled and returned to the caller at DpcBufAddr, and its actual size is written to DpcActualSizeAddr. </para>    </detaileddescription>
    <location file="/proj/xhdsswstaff1/bhawanas/patch_integration/auto_jobs/esw_github_doxy/git/2026.2/embeddedsw/lib/sw_services/xilasu/src/common/xasu_provisioninfo.h" line="253" column="1" bodyfile="/proj/xhdsswstaff1/bhawanas/patch_integration/auto_jobs/esw_github_doxy/git/2026.2/embeddedsw/lib/sw_services/xilasu/src/common/xasu_provisioninfo.h" bodystart="253" bodyend="260"/>
